      "text": "还好我来发蛋糕给店员，\\n才不至于爽约～\\r\\n……太幸运了！[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
